  "term_and_condition": "<p><br></p><h1 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:15pt;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:small-caps;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">BRAND AMBASSADOR</span></h1><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: center;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:26.4pt 0pt 10.8pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:13.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:small-caps;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">WE'RE LOOKING FOR BRAND AMBASSADORS</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Terms &amp; Conditions</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">(Dated: 6th July 2021)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">By&nbsp;applying for this position, you agree to be bound by these terms and conditions (our Brand Ambassador Policy). If you do not agree with any of the terms of this Policy, then you should not take part in this application process.</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">1. THE POLICY</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This&nbsp;Brand Ambassador Policy&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">(“this policy”)</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212b36;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> is the official privacy policy of Gorilla Sunnies ABN 78 789 958 448 and any of its wholly owned subsidiaries (hereafter collectively referred to as the </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212b36;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">“Gorilla Sunnies Group”</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212b36;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> or </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212b36;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">“we”</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212b36;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212b36;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">“us”</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212b36;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">, or </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212b36;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">“our”</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212b36;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">2. WHAT IS AN AMBASSADOR</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We are opening our doors to anyone and everyone who loves taking photos and who shares our Gorilla Sunnies Ethos.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We are looking for brand ambassadors that share our love of supporting women. There are no size requirements, we’ve opened this to women of all sizes and shapes.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Starting from&nbsp;Tuesday 6th July&nbsp;2021 we will announce that we are&nbsp;looking for our very own Brand Ambassadors&nbsp;via a post on our Facebook &amp; Instagram account.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">As a Brand Ambassador, successful prize winners will have the opportunity to post and share positive photos and messages in association with our brand for a period of 3 months and earn a commission from sales generated through the use of your Ambassador unique code, which we will provide.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">3. HOW TO&nbsp;BECOME AN AMBASSADOR</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Ambassador Program is free to enter and no purchase is necessary.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Only one entry will be accepted per person. Multiple entries from the same person will be disqualified.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">To&nbsp;apply&nbsp;send an email to </span><a href=\"mailto:hello@gorillasunnies.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">hello@gorillasunnies.com</span></a><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> with your Instagram handle and Facebook profile link, along with a brief outline of why you think you'd be perfect for this position.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Applications will open 12:00 AEST on&nbsp;Tuesday 6th July 2021 (“opening date”)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Applications&nbsp;that are late, lost, delayed, misdirected, incomplete or cannot be delivered or entered for a technical or other reason will not be accepted.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">This&nbsp;position is in no way sponsored, endorsed, administered by or associated with Instagram or Facebook. By entering, entrants confirm the release of Instagram and Facebook of responsibility for this prize draw and agree to Instagram and Facebook’s Terms of Use.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">4. ELIGIBILITY AND SELECTION CRITERIA</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Applicants&nbsp;must be aged 18 years or over to participate in the Ambassador Program.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We reserve the right to ask any winner to provide proof of age.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Applicants&nbsp;must have a valid email address and valid Facebook and Instagram account to participate in the Ambassador Program.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Applicants must also reside within countries eligible to receive deliveries from us – if you reside within a country in which we cannot deliver, you are ineligible to participate in the&nbsp;Ambassador Program.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We reserve all rights (at our sole discretion) to decide if the eligibility criteria is met and/or to disqualify you from the Ambassador Program&nbsp;if your conduct is contrary to the spirit or intention of the position.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">In applying for the Ambassador Program, you confirm that you are eligible to do so and eligible to claim any prize you may win.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">To be a successful applicant your current content must be on brand for Gorilla Sunnies. We support women &amp; encourage everyone to love themselves as they are.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Recommended but not required 10,000+ followers on Instagram as you will be given a swipe up link that you will make commission on.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">5. NOTIFICATION OF SUCCESSFUL AMBASSADORS</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">You will be advised via email what tier of our Ambassador Program you've been approved for once your application has been approved.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Successful applicants&nbsp;will be notified via email.&nbsp; We may extend the application period at any time at our discretion.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Our decision regarding any aspect of the&nbsp;application process is final and binding and no correspondence will be entered into about it.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">If an applicant does not respond to the&nbsp;email within 48 hours of being notified by us, then they will forfeit their&nbsp;position and we may offer the&nbsp;position to the next eligible entrant.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We must either publish or make available information that indicates that we've selected our Brand Ambassador/s. To comply with this obligation we will send the surname and country of the winners to anyone who emails a request to hello@gorillasunnies.com within 1 month after selection.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We will&nbsp;announce via our Facebook &amp; Instagram account our Brand Ambassadors in either the Gorilla social channel stories or comments of our&nbsp;application&nbsp;announcement posts.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you have an objection to any or all of your surname and country being published or made available, please email us at hello@gorillasunnies.com. In such circumstances, we must still provide the information to the relevant authority on request.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We reserve the right to withdraw an ambassadorship (or any part of it) if an applicant breaches any of these terms and conditions or if they are found to have acted in a dishonest or fraudulent manner.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">6.</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space:pre;\">\t</span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">CONDITIONS OF AMBASSADORSHIP PROGRAM</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Successful applicants may receive a pack of our gear to showcase throughout your Ambassadorship.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Minimum post requirements are 2 x Posts &amp; 2 x Story’s per month. The Ambassadorship will run for 3 months.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">To make money from this experience you will receive a swipe up link to shop and a unique coupon code for you to share on your Story and Instagram posts. Each sale generated from these will earn you a percentage of the sale. If orders are submitted without using your coupon code, these orders will not be credited to your account and there will be no cash compensation provided by us. Only one coupon code may be applied per order.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">You agree that you are not an employee of Gorilla Sunnies for any reason.&nbsp; Your commission comprises the whole of your remuneration from us for your shared content and you must pay your own costs of creating and sharing your content.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">You agree that social media can be a sensitive environment.&nbsp; You agree that you will not share images, information or other materials in connection with our brand, that are or may be considered discriminatory, defamatory, offensive, or objectionable in any way.&nbsp; Gorilla Sunnies does not endorse any particular religious or political views, you must not share content, in association with our brand, that purports to endorse any religious or political views.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:19.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">You agree that you will not resell any of our products, whether on websites on the internet or retail establishments, without our consent. The extent of your Ambassadorship is limited to your promotion of our brand and sharing of the swipe up link and code for your followers to shop with us.&nbsp; You must not use the swipe up link and code to purchase items yourself for resale by you or any other person.As your Ambassadorship is a prize, you agree that we may terminate your Ambassadorship by written notice to you at any time and for any reason.&nbsp; You specifically agree that we may terminate your Ambassadorship if we form the reasonable opinion that:</span></p><ol style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha;font-size:12pt;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">you have breached the terms of this Policy; or</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:19.2pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">your current or past content negatively impacts on our brand or image.</span></p></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">If we terminate your prize Ambassadorship, we must still pay you your commission on any orders submitted with your code prior to the termination, subject always to our rights against you in case of a breach of this Policy.&nbsp; You will not have any other claim against us in connection with the termination and must not represent yourself as an Ambassador or in any other way connected with our business after the termination of your Ambassadorship, except as we may agree in writing.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">6. PUBLICITY &amp; DATA PROTECTION</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">By applying for an Ambassadorship, you agree that we may re-post, publicise and otherwise use any text, photographs, graphics, video or audio or any other materials that you post in connection with&nbsp;your Ambassadorship&nbsp;(including as part of the entry process or as part of a prize) or if you tag or mention @gorillasunnies in any such content, whether via the same platform that you posted or shared the content, as well as via other social media platforms that we use, and on our websites and this right continues despite expiry or termination of your Ambassadorship.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you are a winner, we will contact you with further details if we want to get you involved in any publicity and/or events that we have planned.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We will only process your personal data in accordance with our Privacy Policy and as set out in these terms and conditions with regard to the announcement of the successful applicants and fulfilment, delivery and arrangement of the Ambassador Packs.&nbsp; By applying for an Ambassadorship, you declare that you have read and are satisfied with our Privacy Policy.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">7. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">You agree to share and post at your risk and insofar as is permitted by law, we, our affiliates, agents, distributors, representatives and/or employees will not in any circumstances be responsible or liable to compensate any winner or accept liability for any loss, damage, personal injury or death occurring as a result of taking up the prize except where it is caused by our negligence or the negligence of our affiliates, agents, distributors, representatives and/or that of our employees. Your statutory rights are not affected.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">8. GOVERNING LAW &amp; JURISDICTION</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">These terms and conditions will be governed by laws of Queensland, Australia.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We and you each agree to submit to the non-exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Queensland, Australia in the Brisbane CBD.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">9. CONTACTING US</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">For concerns, complaints or further information regarding this policy and our policies and procedures regarding competitions &amp; giveaways, please contact us at the following address:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The Privacy Officer – Gorilla Sunnies Group</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Address for postage: Gorilla Sunnies</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">PO Box 1353</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Noosa Heads QLD 4567</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Telephone: </span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#212b36;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">+61 484 716 931</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 19.2pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Email: hello@gorillasunnies.com</span></p><p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-955e2423-7fff-878c-f927-c50527c0be6e\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:19.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial;color:#1c1b1b;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">We will respond to your enquiry as soon as possible.</span></p>",
